    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Purtill are thrilled to present Apartment 21, Killegland Meadows.\r\nA bright and airy owner occupied, three bedroom apartment, in well maintained condition, located on the ground floor of this established and popular development in the heart of Ashbourne.\r\nNo. 21 benefits from two balconies over looking the park and is ready for immediate occupancy.\r\nSpacious accommodation comprises a large, open-plan kitchen/ dining room, coat closet, three bedrooms (master bedroom with en-suite) and a family bathroom completes the look for this move-in ready home.\r\nLocated centrally in Ashbourne, Killegland is an exceptional location, just a short stroll to Main street and equal distance to the park and playground. Killegland offers a private underground carpark with lift-access making this an ideal investment for those looking for close proximity to Dublin and access to all major road networks such as the M2, N2. Ashbourne offers a range of facilities such as schools, restaurants, bars, hotel, cinema, bowling, Emerald Park and much more.\r\nFor enquiries, email or call Sabrina 087 1398322.\r\nViewing comes highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nWelcoming hallway with coat closet gives access to all rooms\r\n\r\nKitchen/ dining/ living room - \r\nTo end of hallway finds a light filled, open-plan kitchen with dining/ living room with feature tv wall unit and electric fireplace. Access to balcony offers additional outdoor space, perfect for dining al fresco.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - \r\nDouble bedroom to side of property, with built-in wardrobe and access to balcony\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - \r\nDouble bedroom to rear of property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - \r\nMaster bedroom to rear of property with built-in wardrobe, access to balcony and en-suite.\r\n\r\nEn-suite - \r\nOff master bedroom with w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\r\n\r\nBatroom - \r\nWith w.c., w.h.b. and bathtub.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ready for immediate occupancy\r\nOwner occupied\r\n'B' energy rating\r\nEscalator to multi-story carpark\r\nTwo large balconies\r\nBright and spacious home\r\nGround floor apartment\r\nLocated in center of Ashbourne"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
